<% content_for(:html_title, 'SOVO 智居电子签约中心') %>
<% content_for(:html_description, 'SOVO 智居电子签约中心。通过专属安全链接查看和签署租住文件；流程完成后，可下载并通过邮件获取签署副本。') %>

<main class="sovo-home">
  <section class="sovo-home__hero" aria-labelledby="sovo-home-title">
    <div>
      <div class="sovo-home__eyebrow">SOVO 智居 · 电子签约中心</div>
      <h1 id="sovo-home-title">签署清晰，<br>入住安心。</h1>
      <p class="sovo-home__lead">
        在这里安全查看并完成您的租住文件。签署过程有清楚的步骤提示；所有相关签署完成后，您可以下载最终文件，并通过邮件保存签署副本。
        <br><span style="font-size:.92em;">Review and sign your tenancy documents securely. Once all parties have signed, you can download the final document and receive a copy by email.</span>
      </p>
      <div class="sovo-home__note">
        <span class="sovo-home__note-mark" aria-hidden="true">i</span>
        <p><strong>签署人请使用邀请邮件中的专属链接。</strong><br>无需在此创建账户；请勿将个人签署链接转发给他人。<br><span style="font-size:.92em;">Signers should use the private link in their invitation email. No account is required; do not forward your signing link.</span></p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <aside class="sovo-process" aria-labelledby="sovo-process-title">
      <h2 id="sovo-process-title">签署流程</h2>
      <ol>
        <li>
          <span class="sovo-process__number" aria-hidden="true">01</span>
          <div><strong>查阅文件 <span style="color:#687691;font-size:.88em;font-weight:500;">· Review</span></strong><p>核对姓名、租期、房间和付款条款；有疑问时先联系您的顾问。<br>Check your name, dates, room and payment terms before signing.</p></div>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="sovo-process__number" aria-hidden="true">02</span>
          <div><strong>完成电子签署 <span style="color:#687691;font-size:.88em;font-weight:500;">· Sign</span></strong><p>阅读电子记录与签名披露，确认后按页面提示完成签名。<br>Review the disclosure and follow the on-screen signing steps.</p></div>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="sovo-process__number" aria-hidden="true">03</span>
          <div><strong>保存签署副本 <span style="color:#687691;font-size:.88em;font-weight:500;">· Keep your copy</span></strong><p>所有签署人完成后，页面会显示完成状态；签署文件副本会发送至参与签署的邮箱。<br>After everyone signs, the final copy is emailed to the signing participants.</p></div>
        </li>
      </ol>
    </aside>
  </section>

  <footer class="sovo-home__footer">
    <span>SOVO 智居电子签约中心</span>
    <span>安全签署 · 电子存档 · 随时查阅</span>
  </footer>
</main>
